# T_SCRE: an item's notes edited in the memo editor and saved, the save
# answered "-ERR 501" (the server is shutting down): the message, then
# the editor, the form and the list left and the program ended, so the
# next command, the location list, never runs.
K ENTER CTRL-E PGDN F4
T Lost line.
K CTRL-S
S ENDED
K ENTER
